><span begin="01:47.631" end="01:47.951">me </span><span begin="01:47.951" end="01:50.001">in</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.381" end="01:52.881"><span begin="01:50.381" end="01:50.691">And </span><span begin="01:50.691" end="01:50.941">catch </span><span begin="01:50.941" end="01:51.191">me </span><span begin="01:51.191" end="01:51.501">when </span><span begin="01:51.501" end="01:51.811">I </span><span begin="01:51.811" end="01:52.881">fall</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.371" end="01:56.001"><span begin="01:53.371" end="01:53.691">I'm </span><span begin="01:53.691" end="01:53.941">waiting </span><span begin="01:53.941" end="01:54.311">on </span><span begin="01:54.311" end="01:54.621">the </span><span begin="01:54.621" end="01:56.001">edge</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.681" end="01:58.431"><span begin="01:56.681" end="01:56.991">Uncut </span><span begin="01:56.991" end="01:57.311">my </span><span begin="01:57.311" end="01:58.431">soul</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.801" end="02:00.421"><span begin="01:58.801" end="01:59.181">Snip </span><span begin="01:59.181" end="01:59.801">by </span><span begin="01:59.801" end="02:00.421">snip</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.051" end="02:02.051"><span begin="02:01.051" end="02:01.361">I'm </span><span begin="02:01.361" end="02:01.671">oozing </span><span begin="02:01.671" end="02:02.051">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.301" end="02:03.731"><span begin="02:02.301" end="02:02.671">Bit </span><span begin="02:02.861" end="02:03.171">by </span><span begin="02:03.171" end="02:03.731">bit</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.111" end="02:05.041"><span begin="02:04.111" end="02:04.421">I'm </span><span begin="02:04.421" end="02:04.731">taking </span><span begin="02:04.731" end="02:05.041">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.291" end="02:06.791"><span begin="02:05.291" end="02:05.671">Step </span><span begin="02:05.981" end="02:06.291">by </span><span begin="02:06.2